The state table as agreed, so it is on the record and signed.

  OPEN      -> CLOSING   on tide-high or manual
  CLOSING   -> CLOSED    on limit-switch
  CLOSING   -> OPEN      on obstruction (reader stays disabled)
  CLOSED    -> OPENING   on tide-low and lamps-lit
  OPENING   -> OPEN      on limit-switch

The signature covers the part above exactly as transmitted, including
its headers and its transfer encoding. Canonicalization mistakes here
are the classic reason a signature that is fine reports as broken.

Jonas

